title: Try refactoring sequential to nested definitions
pid: ee350eae-b0f5-4d80-ac9c-ebdeaaf8ec9b
body: |2-
  See [[id:bf2793e0-b1b8-4d63-96d4-ab1096796506][the archived refactoring examples]] when applying this refactor.
  That is a specific reference, not a request to read the whole archive.
  Do this to everything you write,
  and look for opportunities to do it in everything you use.
